## 2. Super Cycle Identification

### The Framework

Gerstner identifies **super cycles** — technology-driven macroeconomic waves that redefine entire sectors. He tracks four in his career:

| Super Cycle | Trigger | Peak | Gerstner Entry |
|-------------|---------|------|----------------|
| **Internet** | Netscape IPO 1995/AOL 1996 | 2000 | Late 1990s (Battery Ventures) |
| **Mobile** | iPhone 2007 | ~2014 | 2009–2012 |
| **Cloud** | AWS re:Invent/Snowflake 2012 | 2021 | 2012 onward |
| **AI** | ChatGPT Nov 2022 / GitHub Copilot | ?? (2030?) | Late 2022 |

### The "Anthropologist" Approach

Gerstner describes himself not as an economist but as an **anthropologist of technology**:

> *"I'm an anthropologist of technology. I go to the frontier, I live with the natives, I understand their tools, their frustrations, their rituals. Then I come back and place my bets."*

**Methodology:**
1. **Live at the frontier** — spend time with engineers, developers, early adopters at the cutting edge
2. **Identify friction** — what is technically possible that incumbents cannot do? What is the "unlock"?
3. **Find the bottleneck** — in every super cycle, there is a constrained resource that captures disproportionate value
4. **Bet on infrastructure first** — before applications, before consumer adoption, invest in the enabling layer
5. **Wait for the "hair on fire" moment** — the signal is when incumbents are desperate, not curious

### Super Cycle Signals

**Internet (1996):** Netscape IPO = signal. "Every company will have a website — not a brochure, a business."

**Mobile (2009):** iPhone App Store launch = signal. "The phone is the new computer. Everything moves to a screen in your pocket."

**Cloud (2012):** Snowflake founding + AWS re:Invent = signal. "Data leaves the data center. Compute and storage unbundle."

**AI (2022):** ChatGPT reaches 100M users in 2 months = signal. "Marginal cost of cognition goes to zero."

> *"Every 10-12 years, a new computing paradigm emerges. Each one is 10x bigger than the last. AI is the fourth wave I've ridden. It will be the biggest."* — Brad Gerstner

### What Super Cycles Are NOT

- Crypto/Web3 — Gerstner has been publicly skeptical: *"I don't see a super cycle. I see speculation masquerading as innovation."*
- Metaverse (as originally pitched) — Overhyped pre-AI; AI is the real paradigm shift
- Autonomous vehicles (timeline) — Too far out, capital intensity too high, regulatory uncertainty too great

