## 16. 20-Criteria Rubric

### The Framework

Altimeter's **20-Criteria Investment Rubric** — used for every position, private and public. Each criterion scored 1–10. Minimum threshold: ~160/200.

### Macro Thesis (4 criteria)

| # | Criterion | Weight | Scoring Guide |
|---|-----------|--------|---------------|
| 1 | **Super Cycle Alignment** | 10x | Is this in a super cycle wave? (Internet/Mobile/Cloud/AI) |
| 2 | **Deflationary Technology** | 8x | Does this technology reduce cost of something 10x? |
| 3 | **TAM Expansion** | 8x | Is the market growing 20%+ CAGR? Can it 10x? |
| 4 | **Regulatory Tailwind** | 6x | Is regulation helping (net) or at least neutral? |

### Company Assessment (10 criteria)

| # | Criterion | Weight | Scoring Guide |
|---|-----------|--------|---------------|
| 5 | **Founder-Market Fit** | 10x | Is this the right founder for this problem at this time? |
| 6 | **Engine Profile** | 8x | Is the team C+ F+ A+ P? Curiosity, Fearlessness, Analytical, Process? |
| 7 | **Technical Moat** | 10x | Is there hard-to-replicate IP? 5+ year lead? |
| 8 | **Data Moat** | 8x | Does proprietary data compound? (Token flow = durable) |
| 9 | **Network Effects** | 8x | Do users bring more users? (Direct, indirect, data network effects) |
| 10 | **Unit Economics** | 8x | LTV/CAC > 5x? Gross margins > 70%? Path to >30% FCF margins? |
| 11 | **Revenue Quality** | 8x | Is revenue recurring? Consumption-based? Predictable? |
| 12 | **Churn / Retention** | 6x | Net revenue retention > 120%? Gross retention > 90%? |
| 13 | **AI Vulnerability** | 10x | Is this company in the token flow? Or will AI destroy it? |
| 14 | **Competitive Position** | 8x | Is #1 or #2 in the category? Share expanding or contracting? |

### Valuation (3 criteria)

| # | Criterion | Weight | Scoring Guide |
|---|-----------|--------|---------------|
| 15 | **Entry Valuation** | 10x | Is it at 3-6-9 sentiment level? (30=expensive, 90=cheap) |
| 16 | **Risk/Reward Asymmetry** | 10x | Can I 5x my money? Is downside protected? (2:1+ upside/downside) |
| 17 | **Catalyst Timeline** | 6x | Is there a clear catalyst in 6-18 months? (earnings, product launch, regulatory) |

### Portfolio Construction (3 criteria)

| # | Criterion | Weight | Scoring Guide |
|---|-----------|--------|---------------|
| 18 | **Concentration Fit** | 8x | Does this fit in top 12-15 positions? Can it return the fund? |
| 19 | **Correlation Check** | 6x | Does this add diversification? Or am I doubling down on existing bets? |
| 20 | **Vehicle Alignment** | 6x | Does this belong in VC fund (10yr) or public fund (perpetual)? |

### Scoring Methodology

```
Total Score = Σ(Criterion Score × Weight) / Σ(Weight)

Thresholds:
  170-200: Max conviction → 15%+ position size
  150-169: High conviction → 8-15% position
  130-149: Moderate conviction → 3-8% position
  <130: Pass → Don't invest

Note: Private positions scored at Series B/C → must exceed 150 minimum
      Public positions scored continuously → must be above 130 to hold
```

